---
import ResourceLayout from '../layouts/ResourceLayout.astro';
---

<ResourceLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Fulcrum Agentics"
  description="Terms of service for Fulcrum Agentics and the Hermes Shipping Provider."
>
  <section class="site-shell resource-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>Last updated: June 9, 2026</p>
  </section>

  <section class="site-shell resource-body">
    <h2>Use of Services</h2>
    <p>
      Fulcrum Agentics provides operational workflow software and integration
      services, including the Hermes Shipping Provider. Services must be used
      only for lawful business purposes and in accordance with applicable
      platform, carrier, and marketplace rules.
    </p>

    <h2>Merchant Responsibilities</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Provide accurate product, package, destination, and carrier data.</li>
      <li>Maintain required BigCommerce, carrier, and platform credentials.</li>
      <li>Review configuration changes before enabling them in production.</li>
      <li>Comply with carrier, tax, privacy, and shipping regulations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Service Availability</h2>
    <p>
      We work to keep services available and reliable, but carrier APIs,
      commerce platforms, network providers, and merchant configuration can
      affect checkout behavior. We may update, suspend, or modify services when
      required for security, reliability, or platform compatibility.
    </p>

    <h2>No Resale of Data</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell merchant or shopper data. Data processed by the Hermes
      Shipping Provider is used to operate the requested shipping workflow.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation</h2>
    <p>
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, Fulcrum Agentics is not liable for
      indirect, incidental, consequential, or lost-profit damages resulting from
      service use, carrier outages, platform outages, or incorrect merchant data.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:hello@fulcrumagentics.com">hello@fulcrumagentics.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</ResourceLayout>
